{"articleNo":"2667","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2667&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010 동계방학 산업체 현장실습 모집공고(그린에너지)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.30","hit":"11863","attachments":[{"name":"산업체현장실습 신청서(학점인정용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2667&attachNo=1579"},{"name":"산업체 현장실습 참여업체 List1.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2667&attachNo=1701"},{"name":"산업체현장실습 신청서(센터용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2667&attachNo=2550"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">2010학년도 동계방학 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">산업체 현장실습 모집 공고</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">에서는 2010년도 동계방학 산업체 현장실습을 실시하오니 센터 소속 전공의 참여 학생 중 참가 희망 학생들은 신청하길 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 신청대상 : 센터 참여 학생 2학년 ~ 4학년까지&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;[3학기 등록자~8학기 등록자까지]</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 81.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">단, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">8학기 등록자</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">는 실습비지원은 가능하나 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학점은 불인정</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 실습기간 : 2010.12.22(수)~2011.02.28(월)기간 동안 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4주 이상</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 1일 인정 실습시간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">법정근로시간</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 선발인원 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">30명</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(서류 제출 순으로 업체와 연결해줌.)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">5. 지급금액 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">300,000원/1인</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">6. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2010.12.01(수)~2010.12.08(수) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">7. 신청서류(홈페이지 첨부파일 참조)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 현장실습 참여업체List를 참고하여 작성하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">산업체현장실습 신청서(센터용)-필히</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">기간은 공백으로 제출(추후작성).</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 산업체현장실습 신청서(학점인정용)-선택</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">실습기관부분은 공백으로 제출.(최종업체선정 후 작성)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 동계방학 산업체현장실습 완료 후 다음 학기에 수강신청 가능(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2학점</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">).</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 56.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(2011학년도 1학기 성적으로 등재 처리, 재학 중 3번까지만 수강신청 가능)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 56.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">학점인정을 받고자하는 학생은 학점인정용 신청서도 함께 제출.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-LEFT: 56.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">미제출시 학점인정 절대 불가능!</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(8학기 등록자 및 다음 학기 휴학생은 학점 불인정)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">8. 신청방법 : 센터로 방문 후 신청서 제출 및 신청명단 작성.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">9. 이수조건</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 신청서 제출 후 실습기간 동안 현장실습 무사히 완료.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -36.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 실습 완료 후 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">5일 이내</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">실습 일지, 결과보고서, 지원비 신청서, 설문지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 작성하여 제출.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 업체에서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">업체평가서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 수령 후 제출.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -91.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 91.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">10. 제외대상 : 동일기간 타 사업으로 지원을 받은자(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">교육역량과 중복불가</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">) 및 이미 취업한 학생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">11. 문의사항 : 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 행정실 공동실습관 401호</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tel)054-478-7930</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2010. 11. 30.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 7pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
